{"id":"n93723-1-3","stage":4,"title":"식상하다 · 腻味","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93723-1-3-1","ko":"오늘 저녁에 삼겹살 구워 먹을까?","zh":"今天晚上烤五花肉吃怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"晚饭，晚餐","explanation":"저녁：晚饭，晚餐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼겹살","meaning":"五花肉","explanation":"삼겹살：五花肉","readings":[{"term":"삼겹살","audio":"/audio/cf1d1af8e04e0ab0c70e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61847","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼겹살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"구워","meaning":"烤，烧烤","explanation":"굽다：烤，烧烤；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"굽다","audio":"/audio/f7b2a704ff9bb3f2aae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60102","senseId":"1","lemma":"굽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을까?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"晚饭，晚餐","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"晚上吃的饭。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"cf1d1af8e04e0ab0","term":"삼겹살","zh":"五花肉","audio":"/audio/cf1d1af8e04e0ab0c70e.mp3","entryId":"61847","definition":"肥瘦间隔而成三层的猪胸肉。","pronunciation":["삼겹쌀"]},{"id":"f7b2a704ff9bb3f2","term":"굽다","zh":"烤，烧烤","audio":"/audio/f7b2a704ff9bb3f2aae4.mp3","entryId":"60102","definition":"在火上把食物烧熟。","pronunciation":["굽ː따"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/37496f549cf37bc70a80.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93723-1-3-2","ko":"점심에 불고기를 먹었어. 고기는 식상해.","zh":"中午已经吃过烤牛肉了，肉已经吃腻了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심에","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불고기를","meaning":"烤牛肉，烤肉","explanation":"불고기：烤牛肉，烤肉；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불고기","audio":"/audio/0ac627c8cdeac727a9f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26848","senseId":"1","lemma":"불고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고기는","meaning":"肉","explanation":"고기：肉；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"고기","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31685","senseId":"1","lemma":"고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식상해.","meaning":"腻味，吃腻，吃厌，倒胃口","explanation":"식상하다：腻味，吃腻，吃厌，倒胃口；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"식상하다","audio":"/audio/874977c0e1183a83b1bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93723","senseId":"1","lemma":"식상하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"0ac627c8cdeac727","term":"불고기","zh":"烤牛肉，烤肉","audio":"/audio/0ac627c8cdeac727a9f0.mp3","entryId":"26848","definition":"韩国传统料理之一，切薄后加入作料烤制出来的猪肉或牛肉。","pronunciation":["불고기"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"645b9cec60f52032","term":"고기","zh":"肉","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3","entryId":"31685","definition":"食用的动物肉。","pronunciation":["고기"]},{"id":"874977c0e1183a83","term":"식상하다","zh":"腻味，吃腻，吃厌，倒胃口","audio":"/audio/874977c0e1183a83b1bb.mp3","entryId":"93723","definition":"因经常吃某种食物而到达厌烦的状态。","pronunciation":["식쌍하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd22fdb6c33ef1f42c7e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.136,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=93723","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":122,"sequenceScore":1.9627,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["中午已经吃过烤牛肉了，肉已经吃腻了。","今天晚上烤五花肉吃怎么样？","我们的祖父曾经是国会议员。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天晚上烤五花肉吃怎么样？","我们的祖父曾经是国会议员。","中午已经吃过烤牛肉了，肉已经吃腻了。"],"answer":2}]}
